---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ASCII_ART } from '../global.ts';
---
<Layout title="Goobus' Personal Site">

  <div class="hero">
    <pre class="ascii-art" aria-hidden="true">{ASCII_ART}</pre>
    <p class="subtitle">Unemployed Larper Larping Code<span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true">_</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Who is bro?</h2>
      <p>I'm David, and I code random stuff. I spend most of my free time playing chess, drawing, 
        and working on coding projects, like this one. As an amature programmer, I have a few projects,
        include a chess engine, which I discontinued due to how unmaintainable it is, and started a 
        new repository (I will find time to work on it in the future). The main project I am working
        on right now is an interpreter for a custom programming language.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>WIP</h2>
      <p>Not quite sure what I will put here, but I'm sure I have some stuff to say.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  

  <style>
    .hero {
      width: fit-content;
      max-width: 100%;
      margin: 3rem auto 2rem auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .ascii-art {
      font-size: clamp(0.35rem, 1.5vw, 0.75rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      overflow-x: auto;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 2vw, 1rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .subtitle::before {
      content: '> ';
    }

    .cursor {
      animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite;
    }

    @keyframes blink {
      50% { 
				opacity: 0; 
			}
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .cursor { animation: none; }
    }

		@media (max-width: 800px) {
      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-l);
        min-height: auto;
      }
    }

    .cards {
      display: flex;
      max-width: 80rem;
      padding: 1rem;

      margin: 0 auto;

      background-color: rgba(25, 48, 70, 0.08);

      border-radius: 2rem;
      border-width: 2px;
      border-color: rgb(51, 49, 56);
      border-style: solid;
    }

    .card {
      max-width: 50%;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin: 0.5rem;

      background-color: rgba(25, 48, 70, 0.08);

      border-radius: 2rem;
      border-width: 2px;
      border-color: rgb(51, 49, 56);
      border-style: solid;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>